    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπρέπ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be conspicuous</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ
				τί τοι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δούλειον ἐπιπρέπει εἰσοράασθαι εἶδος
					καὶ μέγεθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.252
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυᾷ τὸ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενναῖον ἐπιπρέπει ἐκ πατέρων παισὶ
					λῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					8.44
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Din.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ὀφθαλμὸς ἐ. τῷ μετώπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMar.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>beseem,
